# SIE (Superlinked Inference Engine) rules

## Do not guess the API
Before writing or changing any SIE call, read the matching docs page as Markdown (append `.md` to the page URL) or via @Docs. If the docs do not confirm a field name, leave a `TODO(VERIFY)` comment and log the raw response. Never invent request or response fields.

